    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "4B28867826B0DECA",
      "text": "Ich kann nicht glauben, dass du die Angriffe von\\nmeinen Pokémon abwehren konntest.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "94C02C31DE6427F9",
      "text": "Du bist auch echt gut! Dein Name war Rioba,\\nrichtig? Du hast eine sehr ausgefeilte Taktik.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "94C02931DE6422E0",
      "text": "Aber warum bewacht der Boss höchstpersönlich\\nden Eingang?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "94C02A31DE642493",
      "text": "Hast du kein Vertrauen in deine Kameraden?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_kakutouboss_03",
      "hash64": "4B28877826B0E07D",
      "text": "Pass auf, was du sagst...! Ich bin hier, weil ich nicht\\nwill, dass außer mir noch jemand verletzt wird.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "94C02F31DE642D12",
      "text": "Was für ein gutherziger Boss... Aber na gut, sollen\\nwir uns wieder unserem Kampf widmen?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
